sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as 도크
  participant J as JsonMessagedHandler
  participant SM as LogisticsSystemStateManager
  participant E as EventDataStoreService
  participant DS as DeviceStatusManager
  participant DB as ftmsdb
  participant CM as ConnectionManager
  D->>J: {"type":"heartbeat",<br/>DeviceStatuses[...]}
  J->>SM: GetResponseHeartbeatMessageAsync(msg)
  SM->>SM: SanitizeStatusString_v2<br/>(상태 → "0001,00a0,…")
  SM->>E: UpdateAsync(HeartBeat, dockId,<br/>saveToDb:true)
  E--)DB: 10초마다 Flush →<br/>dock_message_events
  SM->>E: GetAsync(DockSortingActiveParameter)
  SM-->>J: (dockId, 응답 SetParameter)<br/>— 없으면 "Default"
  J->>DS: ProcessHeartbeatMessageAsync(dockId)
  DS->>DS: 인덱스별 이전 상태와 비교
  DS->>DB: 변경분 →<br/>ftms_event_log (알람)
  J->>CM: AddOrUpdateClientNickname(clientId,<br/>dockId)
  J-->>D: HeartBeatResponse<br/>(서버 → 도크 설정 전달)
